// GPU class: low
//
// States a texture edge of 2048 voxels and 8 GB of texture memory. 2048 is the
// hard limit that every known WebGL device holds, so `low`, `medium` and `high`
// differ only by memory.
//
// Use this profile to show a reduction that the memory causes and not the edge.
// A large volume that fits the edge under `gpu/high` may still reduce here.
//
// The profile is a stated value and not a measurement. Nothing probes the
// device, so a real device may hold more or less than this profile states.
//
// Load it with `?customization=gpu/low`.
{
  "bootstrap": {
    "cornerstone.gpuCapabilityProfile": "low"
  }
}
